#! ia 1.0

@principle canon-a13-declared-homes
  meaning
    says "Worked records sit in the homes their workspace declares."
    answers "Where do a workspace's worked records belong?"
  governance
    severity advisory
  subject
    subject-word workspace
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@principle canon-c5b-no-consumer-records
  meaning
    says "A kit carries no live consumer records."
    answers "May a kit carry the live records of the workspaces that consume it?"
  governance
    severity advisory
  subject
    subject-word distribution
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward
